WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.500
Akuma whiffs a standing jab while Ryu is down after heavy Gou Shoryuken.

2
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.750
The second standing jab misses as Ryu rises.

3
00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:02.950
Akuma catches the waking opponent with a forward throw.

4
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:03.800
The throw sends Ryu down beside the corner.
